<title>UK: SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Cup finals since the</p>
<p>competition began in 1955-56 (tabulate under - date, venue,</p>
<p>score):</p>
<p>1956 Paris	Real Madrid 4    Reims 3</p>
<p>1957 Madrid     Real Madrid 2    Fiorentina 0</p>
<p>1958 Brussels   Real Madrid 3    AC Milan 2</p>
<p>1959 Stuttgart  Real Madrid 2    Reims 0</p>
<p>1960 Glasgow    Real Madrid 7    E. Frankfurt 3</p>
<p>1961 Berne	Benfica 3	  Barcelona 2</p>
<p>1962 Amsterdam  Benfica 5	  Real Madrid 3</p>
<p>1963 London     AC Mialn 2	 Benfica 1</p>
<p>1964 Vienna     Internazionale 3 Real Madrid 1</p>
<p>1965 Milan	Internazionale 1 Benfica 0</p>
<p>1966 Brussels   Real Madrid 2    Partizan Belgrade 1</p>
<p>1967 Lisbon     Celtic 2	   Internazionale 1</p>
<p>1968 London     Manchester Utd 4 Benfica 1</p>
<p>1969 Madrid     AC Milan 4	 Ajax 1</p>
<p>1970 Milan	Feyenoord 2	Celtic 1</p>
<p>1971 London     Ajax 2	     Panathinaikos 0</p>
<p>1972 Rotterdam  Ajax 2	     Internazionale 0</p>
<p>1973 Belgrade   Ajax 1	     Juventus 0</p>
<p>1974 Brussels   Bayern Munich 4  Atletico Madrid 0</p>
<p>(after 1-1 draw)</p>
<p>1975 Paris	Bayern Munich 2  Leeds United 0</p>
<p>1976 Glasgow    Bayern Munich 1  St Etienne 0</p>
<p>1977 Rome	 Liverpool 3	B.Moencheng'bach 1</p>
<p>1978 London     Liverpool 1	FC Brugge 0</p>
<p>1979 Munich     Nottingham F 1   Malmo 0</p>
<p>1980 Madrid     Nottingham F 1   Hamburg 0</p>
<p>1981 Paris	Liverpool 1	Real Madrid 0</p>
<p>1982 Rotterdam  Aston Villa 1    Bayern Munich 0</p>
<p>1983 Athens     Hamburg 1	  Juventus 0</p>
<p>1984 Rome	 Liverpool 1	Roma 1</p>
<p>(Liverpool won 4-2 pens)</p>
<p>1985 Brussels   Juventus 1	 Liverpool 0</p>
<p>1986 Seville    Steaua 0	   Barcelona 0</p>
<p>(Steaua won 2-0 pens)</p>
<p>1987 Vienna     Porto 2	    Bayern Munich 1</p>
<p>1988 Stuttgart  PSV Eindhoven 0  Benfica 0</p>
<p>(PSV won 6-5 pens)</p>
<p>1989 Barcelona  AC Milan 4	 Steaua 0</p>
<p>1990 Vienna     AC Milan 1	 Benfica 0</p>
<p>1991 Bari	 Red Star 0	 Marseille 0</p>
<p>(Red Star won 5-3 pens)</p>
<p>1992 London     Barcelona 1	Sampdoria 0</p>
<p>1993 Munich     Marseille 1	AC Milan 0</p>
<p>1994 Athens     AC Milan 4	 Barcelona 0</p>
<p>1995 Vienna     Ajax 1	     AC Milan 0</p>
<p>1996 Rome	 Juventus 1	 Ajax 1</p>
<p>(Juventus won 4-2 pens)</p>
</text>
